      "note": "阻焊开窗单边外扩。票 #19 把 PARAM-MASK-EXPAND-TH-OBLONG / -TH-CIRCLE / -SMD 三条独立参数合并到这里；旧 id 与回滚配方见 knowledge/migrations/rules_v1.json"
    },
